{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_006_01_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:924d676ec58126f8305ad9abe1d4fadf20e5e6a4e18e219b2c419178777561f7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:329d3e6a588530f4ff82e61fa702a1fcfed63edb7f9a2a75c8e07a27025ee9fd",
      "text": "如果我成为偶像，把心意寄托在歌声里，\n那群家伙说不定就会听进去了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7686dcfc2d16532689ba41ee86869c9ab4116bc6014c15f25b5f5a76ec73934d",
      "text": "你……当偶像？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56235cba386fc28491d7bf353629450ff44f31eb5a003e7a5a8d715fd5c349d0",
      "text": "干、干嘛啊，那副表情……\n我想要当偶像很奇怪吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1504962bbf6a1af80da8918852ef58c90584a2381f81397c1d1dc7d68ff6136",
      "text": "不，倒不是奇怪。\n只是觉得你怎么突然冒出这么离谱的念头。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cfea8cdd88a9b9247f37cbcf4ee3afd27e56a3c6800093d3b7ce6987750a935",
      "text": "而且，偶像给人的印象一般都是“笑容”吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f23597eb0b35f6dd0d1b837570d6b00c168903b2319693770606b9cc7793319f",
      "text": "你之前对着迷路的孩子微笑，\n结果把人家吓哭了不是吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff18099541d44dfb567582089a1bb7538ab3845e3f2d20afc34473c7d93a3ba8",
      "text": "啊——……笑、笑容吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:267e9e46879485b5952002bede82d4c278f2b3dbe348b733891692d18a1f8fc6",
      "text": "确实我这张脸经常吓到别人啊……\n眼神凶恶也是一个原因吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9317edc079e0b60f999f30a7a0ec4a41cc1fc4d0fd8db4e747a1e4215ef146e",
      "text": "……但是，我想要把心声传达给那些孩子们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8363f9662be1d449325c79b68e783ffec6ce7cdae58e72dbe7042f481b19deaf",
      "text": "传达给那些正感受着孤独、不安，\n无处安放心思的家伙们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3b0b346461d223833e34341a8df29299c3130ffc6b2997ee13cb29dceba5108",
      "text": "我想要告诉他们，有我在支撑着他们……\n你并不是孤单一人！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
